; Acetone, revision 3.
; Regulatory prose is referenced by stable key and locale. The proprietary
; stabilizer fraction is absent from this public document and disclosed only
; through a separately committed, recipient-bound record.
document "Acetone safety data"
section 1 "Identification"
  sentence product "Acetone"
  field boiling-point 56 celsius
  sentence-ref flammability h225 en
  sentence-ref inflammabilite h225 fr
section 2 "Hazards"
  hazard h225 "Highly flammable liquid and vapour" 2
section 3 "Composition"
  component cas-67-64-1 99
  private-component proprietary-stabilizer regulator
